# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and in checkouts.
#
# The project is developed on Windows and tested on Linux and macOS, and a
# manuscript checked out with CRLF changes the SHA-256 the ledger recorded —
# which would report `ledger-stale` on a clean clone.  Text is LF everywhere;
# the PDF fixtures are binary and must not be touched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf binary
